    <description>Record-triggered Flow on Account that fires after save when NumberOfEmployees changes. Creates tiered expansion Opportunities based on headcount thresholds, emails the account owner, and flags accounts exceeding 1,000 employees for expansion review. For accounts below both thresholds, marks existing open Opportunities for review.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
